# Vaultwarden ops

Admin and ops craft for Vaultwarden / Bitwarden-compatible instances: user and
org inventory, invites, and non-secret config. Prefer MCP when connected; else admin API or authenticated UI.

Never invent org / collection / user ids. Resolve the instance base URL from
operator config — do not hardcode hosts. Report counts and statuses — not
cipher plaintext. Always load `vaultwarden-refuse-leak` with this rule.
